0..52 Comment "//! `joined` closes a task end before a scope exits."
53..56 Comment "//!"
57..136 Comment "//! A scope clause can drop or resume its remaining continuation twice. After a"
137..212 Comment "//! parent joins, the rest holds no task resource. So the scope\'s operation"
213..224 Comment "//! checks."
225..228 Comment "//!"
229..308 Comment "//! The handler forks, receives and closes the task. The exit operation resumes"
309..339 Comment "//! the continuation as `*{}`."
340..343 Comment "//!"
344..421 Comment "//! - see: `authority.gandr` — a parent exits while its task end stays open"
423..462 Comment "// The import gives the task protocols."
